[
  {
    "speaker": "Juntemir",
    "text": "Quick heads-up, I’m allergic to peanuts."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Belbara",
    "text": "I was browsing online earlier and found a really nice jacket."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Juntemir",
    "text": "I work for Galhol Pharmacy, by the way."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Belbara",
    "text": "I might go shopping for shoes soon. Mine are getting pretty worn."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Juntemir",
    "text": "I went to a regatta last Sunday, actually."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Belbara",
    "text": "I love finding a good deal, even if I’m just window-shopping."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Juntemir",
    "text": "I’ve been eyeing a new bag, but I can’t decide which one."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Belbara",
    "text": "My nephew is named Novcorald, by the way."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Juntemir",
    "text": "I should probably stop browsing and finally check out that cart."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Belbara",
    "text": "My favourite colour is green."
  }
]

[
  {
    "speaker": "Wendorith",
    "text": "I finally got a new phone, and I'm still getting used to the screen. It feels so much snappier."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Wenruor",
    "text": "Random fact: my favourite food is pierogi."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Wendorith",
    "text": "Nice! What do you think of the camera on your new phone so far?"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Wenruor",
    "text": "The camera on my new phone is great, especially in low light. I'm still figuring out all the settings."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Wendorith",
    "text": "My rabbit's name is Rikin, by the way."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Wenruor",
    "text": "I keep reaching for my old phone out of habit, but the new one is growing on me."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Wendorith",
    "text": "Haette's rabbit is named Loble."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Wenruor",
    "text": "The battery on my new phone seems to last ages, which is such a relief."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Wendorith",
    "text": "I like how smooth scrolling feels on my new phone. The little details make it fun to use."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Wenruor",
    "text": "My daughter is Ashena."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Wendorith",
    "text": "The new phone's screen is bright enough that I can read it comfortably outside."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Wenruor",
    "text": "I'm still customizing my new phone, but the default setup was pretty easy."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Wendorith",
    "text": "I think I'm finally getting the hang of this new phone."
  }
]

[
  {
    "speaker": "Nuriald",
    "text": "I went to a planetarium last Friday and it was surprisingly calming."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Galnovra",
    "text": "I still can't believe I lost my umbrella again."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Nuriald",
    "text": "Maybe it slid under the seat or something."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Galnovra",
    "text": "I checked around, but no luck so far."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Nuriald",
    "text": "Random fact: my favourite food is gnocchi."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Galnovra",
    "text": "I might have to borrow an umbrella if it rains later."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Nuriald",
    "text": "I went to a museum last Sunday, and I liked the quiet galleries."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Galnovra",
    "text": "Maybe I should get one with a bright handle next time."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Nuriald",
    "text": "A bright one would be easier to spot if it slips away again."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Galnovra",
    "text": "Novdorir is a software engineer, by the way."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Nuriald",
    "text": "I hope the umbrella turns up before the next shower."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Galnovra",
    "text": "Maran's rabbit is named Ganix, apparently."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Nuriald",
    "text": "At least the search gave me an excuse to clear out my bag."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Galnovra",
    "text": "Still no sign of it, but I'm not giving up yet."
  }
]

[
  {
    "speaker": "Tirwyn",
    "text": "We went to an aquarium last Friday, and it was a lovely outing."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Galek",
    "text": "How was your weekend? Mine was pretty relaxed."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Tirwyn",
    "text": "I live in Rineby, by the way."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Galek",
    "text": "Nice! Did you get up to anything fun over the weekend?"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Tirwyn",
    "text": "Mostly took it easy and caught up on a few things. It was nice to have a quiet couple of days."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Galek",
    "text": "Same here, I needed a slow weekend. Feeling more awake now, at least."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Tirwyn",
    "text": "My colleague is Quaena."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Galek",
    "text": "How's your weekend been otherwise? Mine went by so fast."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Tirwyn",
    "text": "My grandmother is Kesette."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Galek",
    "text": "I had a nice, unhurried weekend too; it was just what I needed."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Tirwyn",
    "text": "My rabbit's name is Tavy."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Galek",
    "text": "Aw, cute! Hope your weekend's been treating you well."
  }
]

[
  {
    "speaker": "Hatemine",
    "text": "Hey, how was your weekend? I feel like mine went by so fast."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Quateman",
    "text": "Random fact: my favourite colour is orange."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Hatemine",
    "text": "It really did fly by. I had a pretty relaxing couple of days."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Quateman",
    "text": "Same here, I tried to take it easy and catch up on some rest."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Hatemine",
    "text": "I went to an audition last Sunday, and it was a fun experience."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Quateman",
    "text": "That sounds like a memorable way to spend part of the weekend. Hope you had a good time."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Hatemine",
    "text": "My teammate is Saan."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Quateman",
    "text": "I wish the weekend had lasted a little longer; it was nice to slow down."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Hatemine",
    "text": "Mine is navy blue, by the way."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Quateman",
    "text": "I know what you mean. I'm still easing back into the week."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Hatemine",
    "text": "Same, I could use one more slow morning after the weekend."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Quateman",
    "text": "I went to a fundraiser two days ago, and it was a nice way to spend the evening."
  }
]

[
  {
    "speaker": "Keorwyn",
    "text": "I could go for a cozy film this morning. What kind are you in the mood for?"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Holine",
    "text": "A hobby of mine is chess; I like thinking a few moves ahead."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Keorwyn",
    "text": "I’ve been wanting to watch a clever mystery film. Something with a twist would be fun."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Holine",
    "text": "I went to a reunion two days ago, and it was really nice to catch up."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Keorwyn",
    "text": "A funny film sounds perfect for a slow morning."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Holine",
    "text": "Same, I love when a film makes me laugh without trying too hard."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Keorwyn",
    "text": "Maybe something with a little adventure, too?"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Holine",
    "text": "That’d be great, especially if it has a warm ending."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Keorwyn",
    "text": "I like films that keep the story moving but still leave room to breathe."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Holine",
    "text": "Yeah, a good soundtrack can make those scenes even better."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Keorwyn",
    "text": "Now I’m torn between a mystery and a comedy."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Holine",
    "text": "Pick one with a bit of both and we’re set."
  }
]
